  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 412.04 Criteria for Review",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 412.04 Criteria for Review.\n\n(a) The commissioner shall, after the hearing, adopt rules of the type authorized by RSA 270:61-a if it appears that, consistent with RSA 270:61-a, the public interest requires the use of mooring permits on the body of water.\n\n(b) In determining whether to adopt such rules the commissioner shall consider the factors set forth in RSA 270:61-a.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading) #9544, eff 9-15-09",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c400.html"
